# Draft for maintainer review; not a claim of automatic Path B scoring.
id:                     DRAFT-kuroko-1.4.0-origin-tool-layout
draft:                  true
trigger_tool:           clang|readelf|conan
phase:                  packaging, testing
severity:               2
category:               elf-runtime-path
error_signature:        Error loading shared library libkuroko.so|RUNPATH [$ORIGIN]
match_keywords:         OHOS, musl, ELF, RUNPATH, $ORIGIN, LD_LIBRARY_PATH, Conan runenv, sibling lib directory
title:                  CLI 工具仅有 $ORIGIN RUNPATH 时，bin/lib 分目录打包会丢失共享库
root_cause:             上游工具的 DT_RUNPATH 仅搜索其可执行文件所在的 bin 目录；Conan 包将所需 libkuroko.so 放在兄弟 lib 目录，动态加载器不会自动搜索该目录。
affected_scope:         原生 CLI 工具依赖共享库，且二进制从构建目录迁入 bin、共享库迁入兄弟 lib 的跨平台打包任务
verification_cmd:       readelf -d bin/krk-demo; LD_LIBRARY_PATH= bin/krk-demo; LD_LIBRARY_PATH=lib bin/krk-demo
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           export-conan-runenv-library-path
rec_description:        对照 ELF 的 RUNPATH/NEEDED 和实际包目录；在 Conan package_info 导出 LD_LIBRARY_PATH 或在链接期生成正确的相对 RUNPATH，并以最终包外部运行验证，不只运行构建树产物。
rec_command:            self.runenv_info.prepend_path("LD_LIBRARY_PATH", os.path.join(self.package_folder, "lib"))
rec_auto_fix:           false
principles:
causes:
caused_by:
similar_to:             DRAFT-garmintools-0.12.2-conan-cache-runpath-mask-dlopen；DRAFT-E575-libosip-libtool-hardcode-empty-no-runpath；二者分别为 Conan 缓存掩码和 libtool 绝对 RUNPATH，本条是工具相对 RUNPATH 与包布局不匹配
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
doc_file:               drafts/DRAFT-kuroko-1.4.0-origin-tool-layout.md
last_updated:           2026-09-26
source_event:           archives/k/kuroko/1.4.0/conanfile.py
authors:                tank_you
